    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like strength. it feels like i'm just adding more to the pile. every time i try to help, it just costs more money or more energy that we don't have. i look at them and i just see how much harder their lives are because i'm in them. i feel like if i wasn't even here, everything would just... be lighter. easier for them.",
