      "content": "What you're feeling is incredibly tough and shows just how much you care about your children's happiness and success. But remember that you're not alone, and these moments do not define your strength or worth as a parent. Children thrive with love, not just financial stability or a perfect environment. Focus on what you can do to support them in feeling loved and appreciated. You don't have to do everything, but showing up, even with small gestures, can make a huge difference. And don't hesitate to seek support for yourself too – taking care of your mental and emotional health is important for you and for your family.",
